{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222010","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1522201001:0":{"text":"おい、並んでるのが見えねぇのか？後ろに行けって！","source_cn":"喂，没看到大家都在排队吗？到后面去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECA83D6C4A723FDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522201002:0":{"text":"こっちは急いでるんだ、並んでる暇はない。","source_cn":"我赶时间，没空排队。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE42B131855173FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522201003:0":{"text":"……これは支援の食料だぞ。金持ちがもらうなんて、おかしいじゃねぇか！","source_cn":"……这是赈灾粮，是救命的粮食！你们有钱人凭什么来领？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D44CFA99B975DDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522201004:0":{"text":"ホーリンの者なら、誰もが被災者だ。","source_cn":"哼，呼临城里谁没受灾啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1B08E4ECA87E2B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522201005:0":{"text":"支援ならば、皆に等しく配るべきだろう？","source_cn":"既然是赈灾粮，那就人人有份。凭什么让你们独占？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8BE4C8F1A8CBC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522201006:0":{"text":"……んだよ、その理屈は！？見ろよ、どれだけの人たちが待ってると思う？","source_cn":"什么歪理！你没看见，这么多人都等着这口救命的粮食吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFE115ADC85FFFC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522201007:1":{"text":"いい加減にしろ！いいから並べ！","source_cn":"别吵了！都去排队！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92167700B5FBA192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522201008:1":{"text":"なんでさっき割り込んできた奴に注意しないんだよ？後ろに並ばせろって！","source_cn":"他刚才大摇大摆插队的时候你怎么不说？你让他排到最后去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2D0F1AB1125A020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522201009:0":{"text":"またカリアンか。こんなことも抑えられんとはな！","source_cn":"又是卡利安那个没用的家伙，连这点破事都管不住！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC986A2641571502","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522201010:0":{"text":"おい、貴様ら――騒ぐな！","source_cn":"你们几个——别再吵了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8561955C9D94BF34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522201011:0":{"text":"おっと、揉めてるようだな……","source_cn":"喔，有热闹看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D948393E4F272B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:西蒙":{"text":"シーモン","source":"西蒙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊阿宋":{"text":"イアソン","source":"伊阿宋","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:士兵卡利安":{"text":"兵士のカリアン","source":"士兵卡利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:副将隆尔":{"text":"副官のロンゴス","source":"副将隆尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:摩根":{"text":"モルガン","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":5}}